      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Sample reads the color at its X and Y, a frame later, as a color and as numbers: R, G, B, hue, saturation and lightness. Two Oscillators move the point round the wheel, the small ring marks it, and the swatch in the corner is filled with what it reads. Pull the cables out of X and Y and drag them by hand."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
